  "description": "Luciel the Paladin is sent to eliminate a demon who has plunged an entire village into debauchery with their powers. At the village church, he reunites with Risia, a beautiful and kind nun who was his first love as a child. But when Risia sheds her habit to reveal a seductive truth, a mortified Luciel realizes that she knows all about his unholy desire for her... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)\n\n*Note: Part of CNC Revolution's OOTD Danpyeonseon (OOTD 단편선) Collection.*",
